# Add a second chapter

Your chapters are listed on the left, under [Chapters]{.ui}.

1. Click [Append Item]{.ui}, the plus button beside [Chapters]{.ui}. A new chapter appears below the first, and the editor opens it.
2. Delete the placeholder text.
3. Write a heading and a paragraph, as you did in the first chapter.

``` djot
# Morning

By morning the sea was calm again.
```

The order of the list is the order a reader moves through the book. To change it, point at a chapter and use its up and down arrows.
